      "originalScores": {
        "scale": "Holistic subjective 0\u201310 for observed emulated mobile play: 0 unusable, 5 workable with substantial friction, 7 good with noticeable friction, 10 exceptional and consistently clear/comfortable in assessed scope. Wins and terminal score are not quality grades. Unassessed content receives no inferred enjoyment credit.",
