        "readability": 6.5,
        "reasons": {
          "overallMobile": "A coherent compact mission with strong atmosphere, understandable completion stages and useful touch assistance. View tracking, dense HUD and interrupted manual control coverage limit confidence.",
          "controls": "Two-contact MOVE/FIRE drag, scene turns and DASH registered. Tap aim made engagements approachable. Lost close charging target, several bursts used assist, continuous held-fire comfort and physical ergonomics unassessed.",
          "gameplay": "Receiver recovery, coil states, patrols and defended upload give progression and tactical demands. Offscreen attackers remained consequential. Assisted route dominated traversal; no claim of broad manual mastery or sustained enjoyment.",
          "presentation": "Rain, wet reflections, teal lighting, large title and restrained terminal layout communicate a cohesive mood. Assessment limited to rendered stills and brief live inputs, without audio/performance certification.",
          "usability": "Map selection/route, clear contextual hold labels, objective checkmarks and explicit assisted stats help orient and confirm progress. Managing changing hold phases and rear threats adds friction.",
          "readability": "Primary health, ammo, objectives and terminal results read well. Secondary text, small distant patrol silhouettes and dark architectural surfaces need more effort at this viewport; controls occupy substantial lower screen area."
        }
      },
