          "overallMobile": "Coherent, attractive short mission with helpful navigation and combat feedback; manual combat sample is small and assisted, with target visibility and orientation friction.",
          "controls": "MOVE plus FIRE drag, scene swipe and DASH accepted inputs, with clear labels. Fine aim, continuous holds and successful evasive DASH not established.",
          "gameplay": "Recoveries, coil encounter and uplink offer a clear sequence and different tasks. Reload corrections and active patrols create demands, but route-heavy paused play limits assessment of pacing and combat depth.",
          "presentation": "Strong teal/amber identity, rainy industrial setting and polished title/result screens observed. Audio and hardware rendering unassessed.",
          "usability": "Persistent mission checks, contextual hold action, map route and explicit terminal assist stats aid understanding. Route orientation and repeated contextual holds still need attention.",
          "readability": "Main objective, ammo and progress are clear. Small world labels/distant targets, dark geometry and multiple competing HUD cues are harder on 390px width."
        }
